# XSH iconv_close()
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.

assertion  XSH.iconv_close.001
anchor     functions/iconv_close.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
since      1992
says       iconv_close() of a descriptor returned by iconv_open() returns 0.
test       t/001-returns-zero.c

assertion  XSH.iconv_close.002
anchor     functions/iconv_close.html#DESCRIPTION
class      required
since      1992
says       After iconv_open() followed by iconv_close(), the set of open file
           descriptors is the same as before the open (a file descriptor
           used for the conversion descriptor is closed).
test       t/002-releases-descriptor.c
